# POWERarm Vulkan experiment manifest: the M2 toolchain roots plus vulkan-tools and RADV (unthunked baseline).
# Format: whitespace-separated records, one per line, '#' comments.
#   format N                          manifest format version
#   arch ARCH                         package architecture
#   mirror URL                        default repo base (URL/<repo>/<filename>)
#   keyring-fingerprint FPR           only signatures by this key (or its subkeys) are accepted
#   db REPO SHA256 LAST-MODIFIED      repo database the pins were resolved from (informational)
#   root PKG...                       closure roots; 'resolve' recomputes the pkg lines from them
#   keyring NAME VER REPO FILE SHA256 CSIZE ISIZE   keyring package (signature trust anchor)
#   pkg NAME VER REPO FILE SHA256 CSIZE ISIZE       a package extracted into the sysroot
#   project NAME VERSION URL SHA256   upstream source tarball for M2 builds
#   basetar URL SHA256 SIZE           official rootfs tarball, used only with --base-tarball
